WEBVTT

00:00:01.110 --> 00:00:08.360
Our mission is to gather the Seven Mermaid Princesses and seven pearls to summon forth Aqua Regina-sama. {Sounds better to me then using ''and'' 3 times} {I'm inclined to stick with the original. It might sound weird with extra 'and's, but for consistency and we only need it for about 7 more episodes anyway. -Lexi}

00:00:08.360 --> 00:00:11.280
We're feeling a bit relieved since Karen joined our side,

00:00:11.280 --> 00:00:15.450
but Karen's twin sister, Noelle, is still trapped in Gaito's lair.

00:00:15.450 --> 00:00:19.370
But we're never, ever going to lose to them!

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:24.310
All right! Today again with our Pichi Pichi Voices, it's Live Start!

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.890
When listening to my heart, it bursts open and flies about, just what is this?

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:07.890
Kiite mune no hajikete tobichiru nan darou

00:02:07.890 --> 00:02:10.310
You know, my stomach is grumbling, Lucia-san.

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:11.670
You're right.

00:02:11.670 --> 00:02:14.650
Well then, should we go find a place to eat?

00:02:15.230 --> 00:02:16.610
Hippo!

00:02:16.610 --> 00:02:18.280
We can't afford this kind of place!

00:02:18.280 --> 00:02:21.030
We won't be able to pay for it with the money we have left.

00:02:21.300 --> 00:02:23.140
It's not that, Lucia-san.

00:02:23.140 --> 00:02:26.270
Isn't that person Nikora-san?

00:02:26.710 --> 00:02:27.960
Onee-chan?

00:02:27.960 --> 00:02:31.450
She's having a good time chatting with a guy.

00:02:31.450 --> 00:02:32.500
No way.

00:02:36.420 --> 00:02:37.610
It's true.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:39.930
That's Maki-san from the beach house, right?

00:02:40.870 --> 00:02:42.820
Love Among Grown-Ups.

00:02:47.650 --> 00:02:50.730
Nikora-san said she was going out to buy something.

00:02:50.730 --> 00:02:53.060
The truth is that she had a date with Maki-san.

00:03:06.510 --> 00:03:09.620
Somehow, the mood between them is really good.

00:03:09.620 --> 00:03:13.510
Could they have been going out together from time to time without telling us?

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:15.270
Seems like it.

00:03:15.270 --> 00:03:17.830
But, this could be a big problem.

00:03:17.830 --> 00:03:18.710
Problem?

00:03:18.710 --> 00:03:20.600
Because both of them are adults.

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:23.660
It wouldn't be unnatural if they decided to get married.

00:03:23.660 --> 00:03:25.350
Onee-chan is getting married!?

00:03:28.000 --> 00:03:30.190
Onee-chan looks very happy.

00:03:30.190 --> 00:03:33.450
I have never seen that kind of smile in Pearl Piari.

00:03:33.450 --> 00:03:37.770
Could it be that Onee-chan is also dreaming of love?

00:03:37.770 --> 00:03:38.950
That can't be allowed!

00:03:38.950 --> 00:03:41.990
Love between humans and mermaids is crazy!

00:03:41.990 --> 00:03:45.690
Well then, Nikora-san. I'll be waiting for you in the shop next time.

00:03:45.690 --> 00:03:50.430
Yes. If I can taste the coffee made by you, I'll come over every day.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:51.610
Really?

00:03:51.610 --> 00:03:52.120
Yes.

00:03:53.480 --> 00:03:57.380
Nikora-san. Actually, I have something to give you.

00:03:57.380 --> 00:03:59.000
What is it?

00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.100
I'll show it next time you come over to the shop.

00:04:02.100 --> 00:04:04.300
Yes. I understand.

00:04:04.300 --> 00:04:08.480
What could it be that Maki-san wants to give Nikora-san?

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:11.420
Could it be an engagement ring!?

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:28.290
There's big trouble, Hanon-san!

00:04:29.380 --> 00:04:33.960
Didn't I tell you to knock before you enter the bathroom!? You perverted penguin!

00:04:33.960 --> 00:04:36.930
Hanon! This isn't the time to be angry!

00:04:36.930 --> 00:04:38.170
Onee-chan and Maki-san are going to...

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:41.340
What? Are they finally going to elope?

00:04:41.340 --> 00:04:42.960
It isn't that.

00:04:42.960 --> 00:04:45.410
They didn't go so far as to elope.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:47.930
Hanon, does that mean you knew about the two of them?

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:51.850
Nikora often goes to Maki-san's shop to drink tea.

00:04:51.850 --> 00:04:53.430
Don't tell me you two didn't know that?

00:04:53.430 --> 00:04:55.280
Nope, not at all.

00:04:55.280 --> 00:05:00.020
We only found out just now, when we saw them on a date in public.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:04.360
If you two are really curious about the two of them, just ask them in person.

00:05:06.820 --> 00:05:08.700
Umm... Nikora-san.

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:10.430
What?

00:05:11.880 --> 00:05:14.300
Hippo, hurry up and ask her.

00:05:14.300 --> 00:05:15.300
How can I...

00:05:15.300 --> 00:05:18.510
You should do it yourself.

00:05:18.510 --> 00:05:22.090
How can I ask Onee-chan about such a thing?

00:05:22.090 --> 00:05:23.450
What is it?

00:05:23.450 --> 00:05:25.550
Do you have anything that you want to ask me?

00:05:25.550 --> 00:05:28.740
Onee-chan, did anything good happen to you recently?

00:05:28.740 --> 00:05:32.280
Not exactly recently, but things that you haven't told us about.

00:05:32.280 --> 00:05:35.080
There weren't really any good things that happened to me recently.

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.470
Pearl Piari is still in the red.

00:05:37.470 --> 00:05:39.150
We're not talking about that...

00:05:39.150 --> 00:05:40.610
How should I put it...

00:05:40.610 --> 00:05:43.780
What is it already!? If you have a question, hurry up and ask me properly!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:47.740
Like I said, is there someone that you like...

00:05:47.740 --> 00:05:49.160
Person I like?

00:05:50.880 --> 00:05:51.910
There is.

00:05:52.610 --> 00:05:54.220
Is he really...

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:55.700
Maki-san of the beach house?

00:05:55.700 --> 00:05:57.080
Yeah.

00:05:57.080 --> 00:05:58.420
Is there something wrong with that?

00:05:58.420 --> 00:06:01.870
Uh, no... It's just that we didn't know about it before.

00:06:01.870 --> 00:06:04.340
Onee-chan, you should have told us about it.

00:06:04.340 --> 00:06:06.260
What can you do even if I told you?

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:07.770
Onee-chan.

00:06:11.050 --> 00:06:12.970
Nikora-san and Maki-san, huh?

00:06:13.330 --> 00:06:20.020
That's right. They've quietly advanced this far without us even knowing.

00:06:20.020 --> 00:06:22.940
This is definitely going to end with a marriage proposal.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:30.780
Today after school, I think I'll go to the beach house and ask Maki-san the truth about this matter.

00:06:30.780 --> 00:06:31.620
Hey, good morning.

00:06:31.880 --> 00:06:32.950
Kaito.

00:06:32.950 --> 00:06:36.910
Hey, Kaito-kun. Have you noticed something different about Maki-san recently?

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.160
Different about Maki-san?

00:06:39.850 --> 00:06:42.950
Come to think of it, he seemed really happy these past few days.

00:06:42.950 --> 00:06:44.350
As I thought!

00:06:44.350 --> 00:06:46.830
What's the matter? What happened exactly?

00:06:46.830 --> 00:06:50.800
We saw Onee-chan on a date with Maki-san yesterday.

00:06:51.980 --> 00:06:54.360
Maki-san has been alone for a long time.

00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:55.260
Isn't it a good thing?

00:06:55.260 --> 00:06:56.890
A good thing...

00:06:57.310 --> 00:06:58.180
Kaito.

00:07:06.370 --> 00:07:07.860
It's delicious.

00:07:08.750 --> 00:07:11.960
Nikora-san, those clothes really suit you.

00:07:11.960 --> 00:07:14.510
You're the one who chose them.

00:07:15.640 --> 00:07:18.580
Maki-san's coffee is really delicious.

00:07:22.370 --> 00:07:26.990
The person in that photo, I think you talked about her awhile ago.

00:07:26.990 --> 00:07:31.170
Yes. That's when Saori-san was only twenty-two years old.

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:32.760
Saori-san...

00:07:33.120 --> 00:07:39.430
I've been told by Kaito many times that I can't get a girlfriend because of this picture.

00:07:39.700 --> 00:07:44.600
But in your heart, Saori-san is always beside you, right?

00:07:46.260 --> 00:07:50.320
No one can take Saori-san's place in your heart, huh...

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:54.170
But, I have finally given her a place.

00:07:57.080 --> 00:08:00.110
This is all because I met you.

00:08:00.110 --> 00:08:01.150
Me?

00:08:02.050 --> 00:08:07.840
You're the first person I can honestly talk to about her.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:09.400
Maki-san.

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:13.100
Actually, there is something I wanted to give you today.

00:08:13.100 --> 00:08:13.980
This is it.

00:08:18.580 --> 00:08:20.100
Maki-san, umm...

00:08:20.100 --> 00:08:24.660
Nikora-san, I've been married before, and I'm a lot older than you.

00:08:24.660 --> 00:08:26.060
So I won't force you.

00:08:26.430 --> 00:08:29.480
But, will you marry me?

00:08:29.920 --> 00:08:31.090
Maki-san.

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:33.740
Umm, I...

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:37.090
I don't expect a quick answer.

00:08:37.090 --> 00:08:38.700
But please think about it.

00:08:44.040 --> 00:08:47.000
Onee-chan is going to marry Maki-san?

00:08:51.380 --> 00:08:53.890
I said it half-jokingly.

00:08:53.890 --> 00:08:57.180
I didn't think he would really propose to her.

00:08:57.180 --> 00:08:59.550
Do you think Nikora-san will accept?

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:04.350
But, she also likes Maki-san, so I'm sure she would agree.

00:09:04.350 --> 00:09:06.000
What are you saying!?

00:09:06.000 --> 00:09:09.190
That mustn't happen! It's unforgivable!

00:09:09.190 --> 00:09:15.420
Why? As long as she doesn't reveal she's a mermaid, why can't they get married?

00:09:15.420 --> 00:09:19.620
Even Kaito said that when it's decided, we should all have a celebration.

00:09:19.620 --> 00:09:21.490
Listen to me, Lucia-san.

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:25.250
We don't know what a maiden in love would blurt out.

00:09:25.250 --> 00:09:30.130
In the worst case, if Nikora-san reveals to Maki-san that she's a mermaid...

00:09:30.130 --> 00:09:31.910
She would turn into bubbles!

00:09:31.910 --> 00:09:34.600
But, I don't think Onee-chan will do that.

00:09:34.600 --> 00:09:39.260
Not just that, it's possible that she'll reveal that all of you are mermaids, too!

00:09:39.260 --> 00:09:42.000
If that happens, we'll also...

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:44.060
Turn into bubbles.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:46.890
We have to prevent this from happening, no matter what.

00:09:46.890 --> 00:09:50.560
We need to think of something to make Nikora-san reject Maki-san's proposal.

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:53.630
But, it just seems a bit sad.

00:09:53.630 --> 00:09:55.690
Having to break up their relationship, I mean.

00:09:55.690 --> 00:09:57.700
You're being too naïve, Lucia-san!

00:09:57.700 --> 00:10:03.650
Nikora-san... No. I should say, is it better for all of the Mermaid Princesses to turn into bubbles!?

00:10:03.650 --> 00:10:05.050
T-That's...

00:10:05.050 --> 00:10:06.480
We don't have a choice.

00:10:09.960 --> 00:10:12.170
Yes, this is the Pearl Piari Hotel.

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:15.200
I'm Maki... May I speak to Nikora-san?

00:10:16.180 --> 00:10:17.210
Hello?

00:10:17.210 --> 00:10:19.510
I'm sorry, but we are busy today.

00:10:19.510 --> 00:10:22.210
No... umm, I want to speak to Nikora-san...

00:10:22.210 --> 00:10:24.380
Didn't I say we're busy today!?

00:10:24.380 --> 00:10:26.680
Please don't call us again.

00:10:26.680 --> 00:10:29.340
Nikora-san is very troubled.

00:10:29.340 --> 00:10:30.930
Nikora-san is very troubled?

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:33.030
That's right. Do you understand?

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:35.550
Who called?

00:10:35.550 --> 00:10:36.480
Umm...

00:10:36.480 --> 00:10:38.770
I-It was a marketer.

00:10:38.770 --> 00:10:40.400
I already took care of him.

00:10:43.350 --> 00:10:45.290
Well then, act according to the plan.

00:10:45.290 --> 00:10:46.120
Understood.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:49.500
We're back!

00:10:49.500 --> 00:10:50.330
Welcome back.

00:10:50.330 --> 00:10:53.230
Maki-san really surprised us, you know?

00:10:53.230 --> 00:10:54.210
Didn't he!

00:10:55.250 --> 00:10:56.550
What happened to Maki-san?

00:10:56.790 --> 00:10:58.710
Listen to this, Nikora-san.

00:10:58.710 --> 00:11:02.490
Just after school, we went to Maki-san's shop and saw it.

00:11:02.490 --> 00:11:08.290
Maki-san was putting in a lot of effort to try to win over a woman in his shop.

00:11:08.880 --> 00:11:10.890
Maki-san is unexpectedly young.

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:14.870
She's a tough one. I can't see any effect.

00:11:15.730 --> 00:11:20.650
Anyway, I heard he owes people a lot of money.

00:11:20.650 --> 00:11:21.910
How scary!

00:11:21.910 --> 00:11:25.310
Could he be trying to woo rich women because of that?

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:27.490
Like the boss of a hotel!

00:11:28.640 --> 00:11:31.710
I think we were a bit too straightforward.

00:11:31.710 --> 00:11:33.640
It's fine as long as we get results.

00:11:33.640 --> 00:11:37.380
It must be terrible to become the bride of that kind of person.

00:11:37.380 --> 00:11:39.270
It is definitely like hell.

00:11:39.270 --> 00:11:40.750
I'm sure of it.

00:11:40.750 --> 00:11:41.490
No way!

00:11:41.490 --> 00:11:46.430
Isn't it bad to have lots of debt, even when he's old!?

00:11:46.750 --> 00:11:48.140
Who are you talking about?

00:11:48.930 --> 00:11:51.510
Maki-san, of course!

00:11:52.890 --> 00:11:54.110
Nikora-san.

00:11:54.110 --> 00:11:56.750
Maki-san, what's the matter?

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:02.780
Sorry to bother you. But I couldn't reach you on the phone.

00:12:02.780 --> 00:12:07.450
Nikora-san, do you have a bit of free time?

00:12:08.020 --> 00:12:10.450
Yes, I do.

00:12:10.450 --> 00:12:13.420
I'm going out for a while, so please take care of the shop.

00:12:13.420 --> 00:12:17.960
Did Maki-san come to get an answer to his proposal?

00:12:18.620 --> 00:12:20.990
This is really bad.

00:12:20.990 --> 00:12:22.700
Hippo, go and follow them.

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:24.030
Leave it to me!

00:12:29.220 --> 00:12:33.450
Maki-san, could it be that you want to hear my answer?

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:37.590
No, I heard that you were troubled.

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:38.890
Is it because of me?

00:12:39.650 --> 00:12:40.990
No, who said that?

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:50.480
You weren't troubling me at all.

00:12:50.480 --> 00:12:52.000
That's great.

00:12:52.630 --> 00:12:54.260
Umm... Nikora-san.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:57.820
Do you want to go on a boat trip with me tomorrow?

00:12:58.790 --> 00:13:00.250
Yes, I'd love to.

00:13:00.510 --> 00:13:03.470
At that time, I would like to hear your answer.

00:13:07.310 --> 00:13:12.940
No matter what your answer is, the coffee I made for you will always have been for your sake.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.240
Don't worry.

00:13:15.050 --> 00:13:16.270
Maki-san.

00:13:30.660 --> 00:13:33.910
Nikora-san! I can explain that!

00:13:33.910 --> 00:13:36.970
It was all for your sake!

00:13:36.970 --> 00:13:39.880
Moreover, we all planned this out together!

00:13:39.880 --> 00:13:41.430
All of you!

00:13:41.430 --> 00:13:42.340
Yes!!

00:13:42.670 --> 00:13:46.870
Geez... I don't know what everyone's worried about.

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:50.090
I don't have time for love and romance right now.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.690
We'll all be going back to the sea when the peaceful days return.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:57.560
Until that day, you are to fulfill your mission of becoming outstanding Mermaid Princesses, okay? {dunno how but i changed duty to mission because we tled it as mission in the first line.}

00:13:57.870 --> 00:14:00.980
As expected from Nikora-san. Very thorough in her work.

00:14:01.300 --> 00:14:04.400
If you understand, go back to your rooms and study!

00:14:09.180 --> 00:14:10.300
Onee-chan.

00:14:35.200 --> 00:14:38.610
She's going to answer Maki-san tomorrow, right?

00:14:38.610 --> 00:14:40.480
Yes, that's what he said.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:44.010
But with the situation now, she should be rejecting him, right?

00:14:44.010 --> 00:14:45.330
Thank goodness.

00:14:45.330 --> 00:14:47.820
Then we won't be turning into bubbles.

00:14:48.430 --> 00:14:49.320
Let's go.

00:14:49.320 --> 00:14:49.910
Yes.

00:14:50.920 --> 00:14:55.410
Onee-chan, are you really going to reject Maki-san's proposal?

00:15:01.550 --> 00:15:04.630
That's... the ring that Maki-san gave her.

00:15:11.840 --> 00:15:13.050
Onee-chan...

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:19.600
Onee-chan!

00:15:21.460 --> 00:15:23.640
Lucia, what are you doing here?

00:15:23.640 --> 00:15:26.020
Onee-chan, you really like Maki-san, don't you!?

00:15:26.020 --> 00:15:26.940
Eh?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.110
Yeah, I like him.

00:15:30.110 --> 00:15:33.250
Then, you should accept his proposal!

00:15:33.250 --> 00:15:35.450
It's natural for you to stay close to the people you love!

00:15:36.180 --> 00:15:37.410
Lucia.

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:41.900
Even if you marry, it's not as if you won't come back to Pearl Piari.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:43.850
You don't have to worry about us.

00:15:43.850 --> 00:15:46.670
We'll do our best to accomplish our mission as Mermaid Princesses.

00:15:49.660 --> 00:15:52.830
You definitely cannot reject Maki-san's proposal!

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:54.600
That's all I wanted to say.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.680
Good night.

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:18.940
I wonder if things will work out between Onee-chan and Maki-san?

00:16:18.940 --> 00:16:19.830
Probably.

00:16:22.990 --> 00:16:24.560
Hey, Kaito.

00:16:24.560 --> 00:16:25.880
Who is this person?

00:16:26.570 --> 00:16:28.670
That's... Maki-san's wife.

00:16:29.620 --> 00:16:31.070
She passed away already.

00:16:31.070 --> 00:16:33.390
But that's something that happened about ten years ago.

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:37.600
After they got married, his wife passed away because of an illness.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.520
But once Maki-san knew she had a terminal illness, he decided to marry her.

00:16:41.880 --> 00:16:44.120
Maki-san had that kind of past...

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:47.960
He often talks to the photo when he's alone.

00:16:47.960 --> 00:16:51.600
These past few days, I heard him talking to that picture.

00:16:51.600 --> 00:16:54.750
He told his wife that Nikora is a good woman, and his wife agreed.

00:16:56.470 --> 00:16:57.910
I see.

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:04.290
This looks delicious.

00:17:04.290 --> 00:17:09.340
I want Maki-san eat up but I think I made a little too much.

00:17:09.660 --> 00:17:10.730
Nikora-san.

00:17:10.730 --> 00:17:11.560
Yes?

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:15.220
About the answer yesterday, can you tell me?

00:17:16.350 --> 00:17:17.680
Maki-san.

00:17:20.660 --> 00:17:21.890
It's finally...

00:17:21.890 --> 00:17:23.360
The moment of truth.

00:17:24.560 --> 00:17:25.840
There they are.

00:17:25.840 --> 00:17:28.150
There are two Mermaid Princess in the sea.

00:17:28.150 --> 00:17:29.370
Those girls...

00:17:29.370 --> 00:17:31.110
To come at a time like this...

00:17:31.110 --> 00:17:32.150
Lucia.

00:17:32.150 --> 00:17:37.860
My my! To actually have three Mermaid Princesses together in one place!

00:17:38.410 --> 00:17:40.870
How did Maki-san's proposal go?

00:17:40.870 --> 00:17:44.390
Nikora was just about to answer him,

00:17:44.390 --> 00:17:47.000
but aren't you supposed to be watching the shop together with Kaito?

00:17:47.000 --> 00:17:49.660
I was worried about Onee-chan, so I came.

00:17:49.660 --> 00:17:50.630
As I thought.

00:17:50.630 --> 00:17:54.110
Those girls. They're completely ignoring us!

00:17:54.110 --> 00:17:56.100
Then, let's take this chance.

00:17:56.690 --> 00:17:57.650
Watch out!

00:17:58.760 --> 00:18:00.230
Let's continue our talk later.

00:18:00.230 --> 00:18:02.930
Yeah, we need to clean them up first.

00:18:02.930 --> 00:18:04.650
Clean up?

00:18:04.650 --> 00:18:07.070
Treating us like trash.

00:18:07.070 --> 00:18:08.100
Unforgivable!

00:18:12.750 --> 00:18:14.650
Pink Pearl Voice!

00:18:15.280 --> 00:18:17.380
Aqua Pearl Voice!

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:19.810
Green Pearl Voice!

00:18:47.760 --> 00:18:49.020
Take this!

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:52.530
Pichi Pichi Voice Live Start!

00:19:33.730 --> 00:19:35.690
No, stop it!

00:19:41.280 --> 00:19:45.220
Yuuri, don't you have a way to prevent us from hearing their song?

00:19:45.620 --> 00:19:47.020
I just thought of it now.

00:19:47.060 --> 00:19:50.580
It seems I forgot to bring something.

00:19:50.710 --> 00:19:53.760
What did you forget to bring at this critical moment!?

00:19:53.760 --> 00:19:55.210
I can't...

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:09.600
Maki-san!

00:20:14.400 --> 00:20:15.480
Maki-san!

00:20:16.900 --> 00:20:19.150
Maki-san! Maki-san!

00:20:23.410 --> 00:20:25.220
S-Saori...

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:34.540
Love Shower Pitch!

00:20:37.010 --> 00:20:38.460
How about an encore?

00:20:39.190 --> 00:20:41.400
Remember this!

00:20:50.720 --> 00:20:51.680
Nikora-san.

00:20:51.960 --> 00:20:54.500
Maki-san, are you alright!?

00:20:54.500 --> 00:20:58.180
D-Didn't I just fall into the sea?

00:20:58.180 --> 00:21:01.410
Maki-san, this is my answer to your proposal.

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:05.720
I like you, Maki-san.

00:21:05.720 --> 00:21:09.080
But... I need a little more time.

00:21:09.340 --> 00:21:12.050
You're the same as me, right?

00:21:15.590 --> 00:21:17.130
You're probably right.

00:21:19.060 --> 00:21:21.880
Maki-san, I'll wait for you.

00:21:22.630 --> 00:21:26.340
Until you can see the real me.

00:21:26.930 --> 00:21:28.170
Nikora-san.

00:21:28.170 --> 00:21:31.260
Until then, I'll return this to you.

00:21:31.810 --> 00:21:32.940
I'm sorry.

00:21:42.900 --> 00:21:44.290
Hey, Kaito.

00:21:44.290 --> 00:21:46.260
How is Maki-san doing?

00:21:46.260 --> 00:21:48.910
No difference. He's the same as always.

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:49.910
I see.

00:21:50.350 --> 00:21:53.790
Why did Onee-chan reject Maki-san's proposal?

00:21:53.790 --> 00:21:55.760
I don't really know.

00:21:55.760 --> 00:21:58.210
I think that's just how love between grown-ups is.

00:22:06.940 --> 00:22:09.320
Love between grown-ups, huh.

00:22:09.320 --> 00:22:14.020
Will the day come when Kaito and I understand a grown-up's love?

00:23:50.360 --> 00:23:55.120
Yuuri-san, there must be a place where both of us can live.

00:23:55.450 --> 00:23:57.430
Even if it's at the end of the earth.

00:23:57.430 --> 00:24:02.960
Hippo-san, if I can be together with you, even if that's in hell, I'll come with you.

00:24:02.960 --> 00:24:07.130
If I can receive your love, no matter where, I will be very happy.

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:10.340
Come on. Let's go to the world where both of us can be together.

00:24:10.340 --> 00:24:13.670
Next episode, Mermaid Melody Pichi Pichi Pitch:

00:24:13.670 --> 00:24:15.530
The Whereabouts of Tears.

00:24:15.530 --> 00:24:19.750
Hippo-san, I love you with all my heart.
